  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "",
      "Sob sob....I know I'm an ugly monster but",
      "I had a crush on Miss Archer. I made a card",
      "for her but other monsters devided the card",
      "into 8 pieces, and took each piece. ",
      "If you collect them, make the complete picture,",
      "and fetch me the card, I will exchange it with",
      "the powerful items I have.",
      "I can't tell you which items I will give you",
      "at the moment, though.",
      "If you bring me the picture of Archer, I may",
      "give you deadly weapon.",
      "If you bring me the picture of King Hoppie,",
      "I may give you durable armory.",
      "Make sure that the weight of the card is more",
      "than 100 points when you bring the picture. ",
      "Otherwise I can't give you the items at all.",
      "I'll wait up for you then.   "
    ]
  },
